      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>The menu bar tells you something is wrong, instead of waiting for you to go
        looking.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>An orange dot on the icon when a port has more than one listener, a server
          has outlived its project folder or worktree, or it accepts connections but
          never answers.</li>
          <li>Hover it to read which — the tooltip names the problem rather than
          counting it.</li>
          <li>A new problem blinks the dot briefly and then settles. Nothing pulses at
          you indefinitely, and it follows Reduce motion.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
